i was sort of didn't know if i was ever  going to be a mom so  i'm excited well the day has finally  come for megan mccain  the 35 year old co-host of the view has  given birth to her first child  with hubby ben dominic megan announced  her pregnancy  in march nine months after experiencing  a devastating miscarriage i always  describe it as the inverse of losing my  dad because my dad was like  the ending of a beautiful long-lived  life  and i grieve that and the way i grieved  having a miscarriage and grieved my  daughter was  what could have been and grieving that  part so  it just hit me a lot harder than i  thought it would megan seemed happy  yet apprehensive while discussing her  baby news with her abc  co-hosts earlier this year amidst the  coronavirus pandemic  we're excited um a little surprised  uh you know it's bittersweet because  there's just a lot of people  in a lot of pain right now and i  obviously would prefer to be in studio  with all of you but  my doctors just i went to many  recommended against it  in may megan revealed in an instagram  post that she and dominic planned to  keep  details of her pregnancy journey private  writing in part quote  i believe children have a right to  privacy and hope you will all understand  as we navigate this  as much as possible going forward  without sacrificing our comfort  or safety megan explained that their  decision was due in part to negative  reactions  she got after posting about her father  senator john mccain's death  quote i learned a lot of hard lessons  about cruelty  that comes with being open and  vulnerable about my personal life  during my dad's cancer fight it used to  really bother me but i think you just  kind of after a certain amount of time  people say things so often  you just get desensitized we want to get  to know her better  so what was she like as a child  ungovernable  the late senator was diagnosed with  brain cancer in 2017.  the same year megan married her  conservative writer hubby  it doesn't get easier i wish i would  tell people it gets easier you just sort  of learn to cope with it better and  that's been the best  advice i've been given in june megan  showed dominic some social media love  thanking him for taking care of quote my  bloated  knocked up swollen pandemic navigating  self  i don't know what i would do these days  without such a strong  loving partner congratulations to the  new parents  you
 

